[{"id":2588001531,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6aQcT7","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. The issue with script editor hover tooltips no longer appearing until you alt-tab out and back in is also fixed with this PR.\r\n\r\nDisabling numlock in the script editor works as intended for navigational purposes, but this was also the case in `master` before this PR.\r\n\r\nCode looks good to me.\r\n\r\n```\r\nOperating System: Fedora Linux 41\r\nKDE Plasma Version: 6.2.5\r\nKDE Frameworks Version: 6.10.0\r\nQt Version: 6.8.1\r\nKernel Version: 6.12.9-200.fc41.x86_64 (64-bit)\r\nGraphics Platform: X11\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\nNumlock OFF | Numlock ON\r\n-|-\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b539847f-d160-483a-abab-956108196828) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86e726b7-e0bb-439f-bd1a-7725aea850f6)\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\n*Notice that Unicode is now \"Kp 0\" instead of \"0\" for **Numlock ON**.*\r\n\r\nNumlock OFF | Numlock ON\r\n-|-\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42c53b91-1c04-4c03-b110-313d1369daba) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/225b923e-a162-41fe-b858-c26ffccd8a0f)\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102169#pullrequestreview-2588001531","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102169","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-31T22:37:49Z"},{"id":2588528686,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6aSdAu","state